//!
//! # Exact answer: M(n) = 3n + o(n) worst-case comparisons
//!
//! ## Lower Bound Argument
//!
//! Information-theoretic: there are C(2k+1, k) valid partitions of {1..n}
//! into {elements < median, median, elements > median}.
